%% V2 主链路流程 — Prompt 到响应 (时序图)

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Client as Client<br/>(SDK/TUI/HTTP)
  participant HTTP as HTTP Handler<br/>packages/server
  participant SV2 as SessionV2<br/>core/session.ts
  participant SI as SessionInput<br/>core/session/input.ts
  participant EV as EventV2<br/>core/event.ts
  participant SE as SessionExecution<br/>execution/local.ts
  participant SC as SessionRunCoordinator<br/>run-coordinator.ts
  participant SR as SessionRunner<br/>runner/llm.ts
  participant CE as Context Epoch<br/>context-epoch.ts
  participant TR as ToolRegistry<br/>tool/registry.ts
  participant LLM as LLM<br/>@opencode-ai/llm
  participant PJ as SessionProjector<br/>session/projector.ts
  participant DB as SQLite

  Client->>HTTP: POST /session/{id}/prompt
  HTTP->>SV2: prompt({ sessionID, prompt, delivery })

  Note over SV2,SI: ① Durable Admission
  SV2->>SI: admit(db, events, input)
  SI->>EV: PromptLifecycle.Admitted
  EV->>PJ: project → session_input row
  EV->>DB: 事务提交
  SV2-->>HTTP: Admitted receipt
  HTTP-->>Client: 202 / admitted

  Note over SV2,SC: ② Advisory Wake (async)
  SV2->>SE: wake(sessionID, admittedSeq)
  SE->>SC: wake(key, seq)
  SC->>SR: run({ sessionID })

  Note over SR,CE: ③ Safe Boundary Promotion
  SR->>SI: hasPending(steer|queue)
  SR->>SI: promoteSteers / promoteNextQueued
  SI->>EV: PromptLifecycle.Promoted
  EV->>PJ: → visible user message
  EV->>DB: 标记 inbox promoted

  Note over SR,CE: ④ Context & History
  SR->>CE: initialize / reconcile at safe boundary
  SR->>DB: SessionHistory.entriesForRunner()

  Note over SR,LLM: ⑤ One Provider Turn
  SR->>TR: materialize(agent.permissions)
  TR-->>SR: definitions + settle hook
  SR->>LLM: stream(request)

  loop Stream Events
    alt Text/Reasoning Delta
      LLM-->>SR: delta event
      SR->>EV: live-only publish
    else Tool Call
      LLM-->>SR: tool-call
      SR->>EV: Tool.Input / Tool.Called (durable)
      SR->>TR: settle(call) [fiber]
      TR->>EV: Tool.Success / Tool.Failed
      SR->>LLM: tool-result
    end
  end

  SR->>SR: await tool fibers
  SR->>DB: reload history

  alt 需要继续 (≤25 steps)
    SR->>SR: runTurnAttempt again
  else drain 完成
    SC->>SC: idle
  end

  Client->>SV2: events({ after: cursor })
  SV2->>EV: aggregateEvents(sessionID)
  EV-->>Client: SSE durable events
